'''Repetition Seals''' are a collection of [[Spells|spells]] that continuously reverts objects to a previous state after undergoing some type of change.

==Description==
Not all repetition seals look the same, but they all share the Sigil of [[Sigils#Repetition|Repetition]] in common. These seals function by causing a target object to become "like new." 
