==Trivia==
* When introduced in [[Chapter 7]], Repetition was labeled as being a sign (矢, ''ya''), which is kept in the [[Volume 2 (Bluebird Novel)|novelization of Volume 2]]. However in [[Chapter 32]] with the Washing Barrels, Repetition was referred to more generally as a seal (陣, ''jin'') as well as in Kitchen [[Chapter 25 (Witch Hat Atelier Kitchen)|Chapter 25]]. It changed again in the Volume 12 and [[Archives of Witch Hat Atelier]] breakdown of the [[Capture Pennant Spell]], where Repetition was labeled as a sigil (紋, ''mon'').
* There are spells using the Repetition Sigil that have not been explicitly referred to as repetition seals, such as the [[Silverwhite Capture Pennant|Capture Pennants spell]].

